    "yqb_faq_Kr4j3Q": {
      "type": "yqb-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_GKr4iG": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "Owners ask",
            "badge_style": "highlight",
            "badge_bg": "",
            "badge_color": "",
            "question": "What exactly do I get when I buy a playbook?",
            "answer": "<p>An instant digital download: the full step-by-step guide as a PDF, plus every parent message, trial script, progress report template, re-enrolment sequence and camp launch email referenced inside it. Yours to keep and reuse every term.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "question_ayLiGw": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "Owners ask",
            "badge_style": "highlight",
            "badge_bg": "",
            "badge_color": "",
            "question": "Does this work for my kind of academy?",
            "answer": "<p>The playbooks are built for swim schools, football, rugby and tennis academies, gymnastics, dance, cheer and martial-arts schools for children, from 50 to 800 students, one to three sites, whether you own the venue or hire a pool or hall by the hour.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "question_tJ84f8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "Parents ask",
            "badge_style": "secondary",
            "badge_bg": "",
            "badge_color": "",
            "question": "Why should I pay when the trial was free?",
            "answer": "<p>This is the question Vol. 02 answers for you. The trial is scripted so the parent sees progress, a plan and a held place, and the enrolment conversation happens before they leave, not in a discount email three days later.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "question_xTKAkx": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "Owners ask",
            "badge_style": "highlight",
            "badge_bg": "",
            "badge_color": "",
            "question": "I already use booking software. Do I need this?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, and the two work together. Software takes the payment and sends the reminder. The playbooks decide what the parent hears before the trial, what happens at the poolside, when the re-enrolment window opens and how the camp gets sold. No software does that for you.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "question_AtnFN9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "Parents ask",
            "badge_style": "secondary",
            "badge_bg": "",
            "badge_color": "",
            "question": "Is my child actually improving?",
            "answer": "<p>The question behind every drop-off. Vol. 03 gives you the progress report format, the level-up moment and the mid-term check-in that make progress visible to the parent, so re-enrolment becomes the obvious next step instead of a decision.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "question_jUx6qd": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "Owners ask",
            "badge_style": "highlight",
            "badge_bg": "",
            "badge_color": "",
            "question": "How fast will I see results?",
            "answer": "<p>Most owners install the trial conversion system in a week and see the next intake convert higher. Retention shows at the next term end. Camps and extras show the first time you run the launch sequence to existing families.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "question_gUXdNj": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "Owners ask",
            "badge_style": "highlight",
